  "readmeFile": "ReadMe.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1 - IniFileHelper.Save maintains existing INI file structure and new Remove method.\n\t\t\t\n2.1.0 - New Security.CredentialProtector: encryption of stored credentials with DPAPI (Windows) or AES and a key file (other systems; AES-GCM on .NET 8, AES-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 on .NET Standard 2.0), also for credentials embedded in a string between configurable tags (default [PWD] / [/PWD]). New dependency System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData 8.0.0.\n- Logging: SimpleLogger and SimpleLog can archive the log files of the months before the current one and the previous ArchiveRetentionMonths months (default 1, minimum 1) into a monthly PREFIXLog_YYYY_MM.zip in the log folder; no log or zip file is ever deleted. The check runs on a background thread whenever the log file name changes (first write, change of date, folder or prefix). New EnableArchiving (default false), ArchiveRetentionMonths and ArchiveLogs().\n- JsonSettings.Save: new optional parameter ignoreBackup (default false) to overwrite the file without saving a backup copy. Assemblies compiled against 2.0.x that call Save must be recompiled.\n- CSVLogItem: the netstandard2.0 build writes DateOnly properties in ISO format (yyyy-MM-ddT00:00:00) like the .NET 8 build, instead of a quoted string in the current culture.\n\n2.0.1 -WebDownloader: optional CancellationToken and inactivity timeout on Download and DownloadAsync; an interrupted download deletes the partial file. Assemblies compiled against 2.0.0 that call WebDownloader must be recompiled.\n\n2.0.0 - Breaking changes, see README for details and migration notes.\n- PasswordHash/PasswordHelper: PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 600,000 iterations, 49-byte versioned hashes and constant-time comparison; 1.x hashes (36 bytes) are still verified and flagged by RequiresRehash.\n- Logging: until LogPath is assigned, SimpleLogger, SimpleLog and CSVLogger follow Paths.DefaultLogsDirectory; DEBUG/PROTOCOL labels in DebugWrite/ProtocolWrite lines; ConditionalLog with independent console and file thresholds.\n- PropertyStringUtils uses its CultureInfo (default CurrentCulture) instead of the thread culture; an invalid string leaves nullable fields unchanged.\n- JsonSettings.Load uses DefaultSerializerOptions; backup names without double dot.\n- NetUtils.CheckDNS returns Reachable false for unknown hosts; EmbeddedResourcesUtils throws InvalidOperationException for a missing resource; DaysOfWeekParameter throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException; CSVLogItem writes null values as \"\".\n- OSKIsNumeric returns bool, SimpleLog.ConsoleLog is static, IPAddressExtensionMethods.TryParseMatch(string, out IPAddress) is obsolete.\n- Bug fixes in ODBC connection string, GCUtils, Paths, PagingCollection, StringUtils, IniFileHelper and WebDownloader; thread-safe PasswordObfuscator and OSKRandom.Shared.",
